WEBVTT

00:07.400 --> 00:12.860
Ah, how nostalgic! 
There's nothing like the air of a battlefield!

00:14.490 --> 00:15.450
Dalmatia!

00:15.450 --> 00:17.020
Inferno!

00:17.020 --> 00:18.370
Inferno!

00:18.370 --> 00:20.250
Inferno!

00:20.720 --> 00:22.010
Oh, my.

00:22.010 --> 00:22.730
Master Cain!

00:22.730 --> 00:23.540
I know.

00:24.080 --> 00:25.470
It's past here, isn't it?

00:26.010 --> 00:28.920
That's where he is.

00:33.450 --> 00:36.870
I'm waiting for you, 
follower of the old geezers.

00:37.360 --> 00:41.600
The game has already begun.

00:44.100 --> 00:45.230
Aaron...

00:56.200 --> 00:59.080
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

02:16.510 --> 02:20.510
"Then I Became Lord of a Domain"

02:18.700 --> 02:19.690
Master Cain.

02:20.250 --> 02:22.280
I will handle things here.

02:22.610 --> 02:24.530
You can go after the ringleader.

02:24.990 --> 02:27.960
Seth... Will you be okay on your own?

02:27.960 --> 02:31.470
Yes. I will summon my underlings.

02:31.840 --> 02:36.260
We may lose a bit of the forest, 
however. Is that acceptable?

02:36.670 --> 02:38.430
As long as it's just a bit...

02:38.430 --> 02:40.810
Just don't go too far, okay?

02:40.810 --> 02:41.930
Is that not...

02:41.930 --> 02:44.010
what I should say to you?

02:45.930 --> 02:47.060
I'm counting on you!

02:47.530 --> 02:49.070
And we shall go, as well.

02:49.070 --> 02:50.470
Follow me, Dalmatia!

02:50.470 --> 02:51.190
At once!

02:54.950 --> 02:56.360
Hurry! Hurry!

02:56.700 --> 02:59.950
Don't let a single one of them 
get near the town! Got that?!

02:59.950 --> 03:02.030
Hey, are you able to sense 
how many monsters are left?

03:02.030 --> 03:04.650
Every time I think there are 
fewer monsters, more show up!

03:04.650 --> 03:06.370
And at a blistering pace!

03:06.370 --> 03:07.490
Danger.

03:07.490 --> 03:09.240
I'm going to the forest!

03:09.240 --> 03:10.710
What are you saying?!

03:10.710 --> 03:13.550
Well, no matter how strong Cain is,

03:13.550 --> 03:16.170
we don't know how many 
monsters are out there!

03:16.170 --> 03:17.340
Even I...

03:17.340 --> 03:19.090
Even I...

03:19.090 --> 03:21.980
want to act the way a 
maestra ought to for once!

03:24.060 --> 03:25.150
I'll go, too.

03:25.150 --> 03:26.080
Nina...

03:26.870 --> 03:28.770
How'd I get such a reckless sister?

03:28.770 --> 03:31.220
Now I have no choice but to go with you.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.560
You don't mind, right?

03:32.560 --> 03:35.750
You know I don't! Let's go, slowpoke!

03:35.750 --> 03:36.940
Yeah!

03:37.440 --> 03:40.420
We'll meet the monsters in the 
forest and stop their advance!

03:41.230 --> 03:43.650
Just you wait, monsters!

03:48.100 --> 03:50.540
Summon! My loyal subjects!

03:52.720 --> 03:54.190
What can we do for you?

03:54.190 --> 03:57.420
It is unusual for our Prince of Darkness 
to summon us, the Four Heavenly Kings.

03:57.420 --> 03:58.820
What has caused this—

03:58.820 --> 03:59.380
Wait...

03:59.750 --> 04:00.620
What is this?!

04:01.450 --> 04:03.930
A friend requested my help.

04:04.590 --> 04:06.800
Sorry to ask, but get things 
under control here.

04:06.800 --> 04:09.390
A f-friend asked you?

04:09.770 --> 04:13.200
How great this friend must be, to make 
a request of the Prince of Darkness!

04:13.890 --> 04:16.240
It is good to see you all again.

04:16.240 --> 04:16.730
L...

04:17.080 --> 04:18.690
Lord Dalmatia!

04:18.690 --> 04:20.710
The legendary demon general!

04:20.710 --> 04:22.280
Great General Dalmatia...

04:22.520 --> 04:23.990
Why are you here?!

04:23.990 --> 04:27.260
I was also asked by Lord Seth's friend,

04:27.260 --> 04:30.350
the one who entered into 
a contract with him.

04:30.350 --> 04:33.450
What?! Someone made a 
contract with Lord Seth?!

04:33.450 --> 04:36.680
Also, this friend asked for your help, too?!

04:36.680 --> 04:37.900
Who is this person?

04:37.900 --> 04:40.090
Yes, great demigod.

04:40.090 --> 04:42.920
That friend is God's Chosen.

04:42.920 --> 04:47.890
Th-The Prince of Darkness entered 
into a contract with God's Chosen?!

04:49.000 --> 04:51.080
I'll explain everything later.

04:51.080 --> 04:55.720
More importantly, the Chosen One 
has ordered me to protect this place!

04:55.720 --> 04:56.860
Which means...

04:57.480 --> 04:59.170
What other choice do we have?!

04:59.170 --> 05:00.360
Right!

05:09.620 --> 05:11.810
Man, I'm getting nowhere at all!

05:13.420 --> 05:14.410
Inferno!

05:15.170 --> 05:16.870
Inferno!

05:21.920 --> 05:23.940
Inferno!

05:29.130 --> 05:30.670
So it's you.

05:31.450 --> 05:35.140
You are the one who took such 
good care of my brethren.

05:36.100 --> 05:39.330
I'd expect nothing less from 
the old geezers' pet dog.

05:39.330 --> 05:41.700
You got here faster than I expected.

05:42.590 --> 05:43.760
It's you, isn't it?!

05:44.280 --> 05:47.060
You're the one who started this onslaught!

05:47.590 --> 05:51.660
Black dragon... no, former 
God of Amusement...

05:51.740 --> 05:52.990
Aaron!

05:54.200 --> 05:58.460
Sadly, though, only part 
of me has been revived.

05:58.460 --> 06:05.050
It's absolutely infuriating that I had 
to borrow the body of this thing!

06:08.550 --> 06:11.020
Aaron! Stop the monsters!

06:11.350 --> 06:14.560
N-Not that he'd listen to me, I guess...

06:16.620 --> 06:18.140
What did I tell you?

06:18.140 --> 06:23.470
This is a game to see whether all the 
humans get devoured by the monsters.

06:23.880 --> 06:26.740
And you ask me to stop the monsters?

06:26.740 --> 06:29.610
You amuse me!

06:31.240 --> 06:32.070
Aaron!

06:32.070 --> 06:39.040
Now, I wonder how long your 
friends can hold out!

06:47.170 --> 06:47.880
Hey!

06:47.880 --> 06:49.640
People are floating in the air!

06:49.640 --> 06:50.160
Ow!

06:50.160 --> 06:52.230
Don't joke at a time like this!

06:52.230 --> 06:55.360
It's not a joke! Just look up!

06:57.310 --> 06:58.970
Those people...

06:58.970 --> 07:01.650
Are they getting rid of 
some of the monsters?

07:01.980 --> 07:04.060
So they're on our side?

07:04.400 --> 07:05.610
They may be friends...

07:06.580 --> 07:07.990
of Cain.

07:08.620 --> 07:11.950
Ah. Of course.

07:12.220 --> 07:14.410
Lord Seth! There are too many!

07:14.410 --> 07:15.870
Take out as many as you can!

07:16.110 --> 07:17.120
At once!

07:17.120 --> 07:19.710
We'll have to let the 
humans handle the rest.

07:19.710 --> 07:20.790
Incoming.

07:21.010 --> 07:22.960
More than I can count.

07:22.960 --> 07:25.210
Start the incantation! 
We won't make it in time!

07:25.580 --> 07:27.270
We'll get the ones in front!

07:27.520 --> 07:28.460
Here they come!

07:34.190 --> 07:36.200
It's infuriating.

07:36.200 --> 07:39.140
Those eyes... Your eyes.

07:39.550 --> 07:43.100
They're the same as the eyes 
of the people who sealed me.

07:46.360 --> 07:50.070
You mean... my mother and father?

07:50.070 --> 07:54.060
I thought I'd wait until 
I got to see you suffer...

07:54.460 --> 07:56.900
But would you just go away right now?

07:57.530 --> 07:59.160
Die!

08:03.450 --> 08:06.130
The monsters... All he did was touch them!

08:12.240 --> 08:13.510
Inferno!

08:17.600 --> 08:18.810
Did I get him?!

08:20.390 --> 08:21.890
I realize...

08:23.180 --> 08:25.260
I'm not at my full strength,

08:25.260 --> 08:28.480
but still, did you think such 
magic would work on me?

08:28.780 --> 08:30.570
I need to work more magic into it!

08:30.570 --> 08:33.920
Are you going to have time for that?!

08:34.070 --> 08:35.810
Air Cutter!

08:35.810 --> 08:37.700
Ice Blizzard!

08:44.460 --> 08:47.080
How long is this gonna go on?!

08:47.080 --> 08:48.170
I dunno!

08:48.610 --> 08:52.870
But I bet we'll get to drink some mighty 
tasty booze when it's all over!

08:53.850 --> 08:55.130
I'll let you this time!

08:55.130 --> 08:56.720
Can't wait...

08:57.050 --> 08:58.550
I can't wait...

08:58.550 --> 09:01.740
...until I can have a drink with Cain!

09:04.500 --> 09:05.840
How long?

09:06.330 --> 09:09.360
How long can you keep that up, I wonder?

09:09.630 --> 09:11.610
Summon! Haku! Gin!

09:17.740 --> 09:19.440
Quit darting around!

09:19.440 --> 09:20.910
You're in the way!

09:23.600 --> 09:24.710
Haku!

09:39.340 --> 09:40.470
Damn you!

09:40.470 --> 09:42.430
How long is this gonna last?!

09:42.430 --> 09:43.770
At this rate...

09:43.770 --> 09:47.270
I'm out of magic... I can't move...

09:47.900 --> 09:48.970
Claude!

09:49.550 --> 09:51.690
Don't worry about us! Retreat!

09:52.010 --> 09:53.070
Shut up!

09:53.380 --> 09:55.490
You only get one life!

09:55.490 --> 09:58.030
Don't be so quick to give it up!

09:58.030 --> 09:59.450
Honey...

10:00.280 --> 10:01.120
Still...

10:02.070 --> 10:05.350
Seriously, how long is this gonna go on?!

10:05.350 --> 10:06.380
We can't—

10:06.380 --> 10:07.710
Bro!

10:09.580 --> 10:10.380
Nina!

10:12.510 --> 10:13.170
Bro!

10:13.510 --> 10:14.630
Bro!

10:21.260 --> 10:23.370
Everyone all right?!

10:26.160 --> 10:27.100
You're...

10:27.420 --> 10:30.860
You've been holding off the 
monsters' advance all this time.

10:30.860 --> 10:32.110
Thank you.

10:32.110 --> 10:33.520
Reinforcements are here!

10:33.770 --> 10:34.630
Huh?

10:34.630 --> 10:36.340
The town's defenses are solid.

10:36.700 --> 10:39.130
From this point on, I, Tijuana...

10:39.660 --> 10:41.620
will defend the front line!

10:42.840 --> 10:43.940
I appreciate it.

10:44.720 --> 10:47.200
But I won't let you do that alone.

10:47.430 --> 10:50.600
If it's gotta be protected, 
we all protect it together!

10:51.240 --> 10:53.790
That's what my good friend always says!

10:57.850 --> 10:58.630
Haku!

10:58.630 --> 10:59.900
Gin!

11:01.470 --> 11:03.490
Don't get cocky!

11:06.970 --> 11:08.760
Haku! Gin!

11:08.760 --> 11:11.810
Shut up! That kind of thing annoys me!

11:12.510 --> 11:13.560
Annoys you?

11:14.010 --> 11:15.690
Annoys you?!

11:16.000 --> 11:18.670
If someone's your friend, you protect them!

11:18.670 --> 11:21.730
If you love someone, you protect them!

11:22.300 --> 11:25.160
What part of that could be annoying?!

11:25.160 --> 11:28.200
Quiet, dog of the old geezers!

11:28.200 --> 11:31.500
The gods have nothing to 
do with this! I just want...

11:31.910 --> 11:33.330
everyone...

11:33.330 --> 11:35.040
all of them...

11:35.040 --> 11:37.800
to be able to smile! That's all!

11:37.800 --> 11:39.630
Overload!

11:39.630 --> 11:41.200
That light...

11:41.590 --> 11:44.930
I-It can't be! The same light from back then?!

11:44.930 --> 11:46.910
Saint Sanctuary!

11:46.910 --> 11:49.350
Protect everyone!

11:49.700 --> 11:51.890
Die!

12:01.640 --> 12:03.160
What is that light?!

12:05.110 --> 12:07.120
What is that?

12:08.930 --> 12:10.370
Oh, gods!

12:10.370 --> 12:14.460
I'm going to protect all their smiles!

12:14.460 --> 12:16.410
Mom... Dad...

12:17.450 --> 12:20.610
Give me more strength!

12:22.560 --> 12:26.180
What is it, Haku, Gin?! I'm busy right now!

12:26.180 --> 12:27.160
How awful.

12:27.160 --> 12:29.810
Yes, how very awful.

12:29.810 --> 12:32.520
We came to see what had happened...

12:34.330 --> 12:36.100
Was <i>this</i> really necessary?

12:36.100 --> 12:39.620
Indeed. God's Chosen or not,

12:39.620 --> 12:43.360
you must learn to discern what 
you should and shouldn't do.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.320
But the black dragon...

12:45.650 --> 12:47.050
Chosen One!

12:47.050 --> 12:49.410
Where do you see a black dragon?

12:49.820 --> 12:50.720
Huh?

12:50.720 --> 12:52.430
Don't "huh?" us!

12:52.430 --> 12:53.520
So then...

12:53.520 --> 12:54.120
Yes.

12:54.400 --> 12:55.420
The onslaught?

12:57.310 --> 12:59.540
The monsters fled to the forest,

12:59.950 --> 13:01.790
and the town is safe.

13:02.760 --> 13:05.070
All the people in the town were saved.

13:05.970 --> 13:07.390
The onslaught...

13:07.630 --> 13:08.950
is over!

13:11.680 --> 13:13.290
Thanks to you, Chosen One.

13:13.770 --> 13:15.480
Cain!

13:15.480 --> 13:16.560
Cain!

13:16.560 --> 13:19.000
Dear husband!

13:19.000 --> 13:20.480
Cain!

13:20.840 --> 13:21.660
<i>I...</i>

13:22.250 --> 13:24.590
<i>protected all of their smiles.</i>

13:25.090 --> 13:27.600
<i>Here in this world...</i>

13:28.110 --> 13:31.260
<i>I can help people!</i>

13:32.130 --> 13:33.540
Good grief.

13:33.540 --> 13:37.180
What a remarkable Chosen One
 the gods have sent.

13:37.540 --> 13:40.620
Yes, but he is a good Chosen One.

13:41.000 --> 13:44.630
Yes, you are absolutely right.

13:49.000 --> 13:50.520
He's a good Chosen One.

13:50.900 --> 13:51.900
Yes.

13:52.810 --> 13:54.420
He truly is.

14:02.230 --> 14:04.170
Cain!

14:04.170 --> 14:06.840
That pillar of light rising to the sky!

14:06.840 --> 14:08.410
What was that?!

14:08.410 --> 14:11.490
I was told that it was visible 
even from the capital!

14:11.730 --> 14:14.580
It was you! You did it, didn't you?!

14:14.970 --> 14:16.410
Well, um...

14:16.720 --> 14:21.920
I was fighting a black dragon in the 
forest, and I fired off a spell...

14:22.550 --> 14:25.030
Some mistakenly believed that the 
radiance of that light pillar

14:25.030 --> 14:29.300
meant the gods had descended upon this land!

14:29.300 --> 14:33.230
I'm sorry. Intermediate 
magic wasn't strong enough,

14:33.230 --> 14:35.020
so I used emperor-level magic...

14:35.250 --> 14:36.980
Emperor-level?!

14:36.980 --> 14:40.710
Cain! Don't use outlandishly powerful magic!

14:40.710 --> 14:43.610
Have I not repeatedly told you 
to practice self-restraint?!

14:43.610 --> 14:45.040
I'm sorry.

14:45.040 --> 14:49.820
Also! A man was seen casting
 magic spells in midair above the forest!

14:49.820 --> 14:51.490
Who was that?!

14:51.490 --> 14:53.260
The Prince of Darkness.

14:53.260 --> 14:56.080
I summoned the Prince of Darkness to help.

14:56.080 --> 14:59.040
The Prince of Darkness?! To <i>help?!</i>

14:59.310 --> 15:02.650
Magna, I'm exhausted.

15:02.650 --> 15:05.120
Cain's going to be marrying 
Telestia, anyway.

15:05.120 --> 15:08.810
Can't I just yield the 
throne to him already?

15:08.810 --> 15:10.350
No, you can't.

15:10.350 --> 15:12.720
Then I must give Cain something...

15:13.350 --> 15:15.430
I believe you considered a domain?

15:15.430 --> 15:16.850
Oh, yes!

15:16.850 --> 15:20.970
As a reward for your exploits, 
and for the future of my Telestia,

15:21.330 --> 15:23.820
I will grant you a domain of your own!

15:26.260 --> 15:28.490
Cain von Silford.

15:28.490 --> 15:29.530
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:29.880 --> 15:33.240
I hereby name you a viscount and 
grant you the domain of Dorinthol.

15:33.240 --> 15:36.940
You will henceforth be known by the 
name Cain von Silford Dorinthol,

15:36.940 --> 15:39.200
and will further devote yourself
 to the kingdom's service.

15:39.420 --> 15:41.050
I humbly accept, Your Majesty.

15:41.050 --> 15:45.340
For the prosperity of the Kingdom of Esfort,

15:45.340 --> 15:49.050
I will devote myself in full to 
the governing of this domain.

15:49.050 --> 15:52.010
What?! Dorinthol?!

15:52.010 --> 15:54.490
It just had to be Dorinthol...

15:56.170 --> 15:57.900
Dear husband!

15:57.900 --> 15:59.830
What? What's the problem?

15:59.830 --> 16:03.560
The adventurers' guild likes to throw 
its weight around in Dorinthol.

16:03.560 --> 16:07.770
Countless nobles have been put in charge 
of that town, only to flee from it!

16:07.770 --> 16:11.110
You mean I'm just being 
shipped off to Dorinthol?

16:11.110 --> 16:14.290
This is cruel! 
I'm going to protest to Father!

16:14.290 --> 16:15.570
Wait a minute.

16:15.990 --> 16:18.790
I'm actually kind of excited.

16:19.960 --> 16:23.300
I mean, I get to build a new town, right?

16:23.300 --> 16:26.540
A brand new town where everyone can smile!

16:26.540 --> 16:27.580
Cain...

16:27.580 --> 16:28.740
Master Cain...

16:28.740 --> 16:29.900
Dear husband!

16:29.900 --> 16:32.510
Let's all build it together!

16:32.860 --> 16:35.420
Of course! We'll make a wonderful town!

16:35.760 --> 16:37.150
But...

16:37.150 --> 16:38.710
Cain...

16:38.710 --> 16:40.570
Just don't overdo it.

16:44.580 --> 16:46.190
Okay, let's go!

16:46.590 --> 16:48.200
To Dorinthol!

16:58.630 --> 17:02.590
What?! Y-You're A-rank?!

17:02.590 --> 17:06.000
Welcome to Dorinthol! Please, come on in!

17:06.000 --> 17:08.210
What happened to him then?!

17:08.210 --> 17:10.920
Upon arriving in Dorinthol,

17:11.220 --> 17:14.300
Master Cain was assaulted by the guild

17:14.680 --> 17:16.970
under the pretense of a "welcome party."

17:16.970 --> 17:18.700
Try to dodge this!

17:18.700 --> 17:19.800
Go!

17:22.080 --> 17:24.180
The arena was heavily damaged...

17:24.180 --> 17:25.890
Heavily damaged?!

17:25.890 --> 17:28.270
And later, at the Cat's Repose...

17:28.510 --> 17:31.400
Did you hear what happened 
to the arena today?

17:31.400 --> 17:33.060
Oh, yeah, I heard!

17:33.060 --> 17:36.110
Apparently, some guy who 
debuted at silver just...

17:37.250 --> 17:39.570
Are you okay, mister?

17:39.570 --> 17:42.570
Yo! Over here! Get a move on!

17:42.570 --> 17:43.660
Here I am!

17:44.110 --> 17:45.910
Took you long enough!

17:45.910 --> 17:47.620
You really shouldn't do that.

17:47.850 --> 17:51.990
...he became outraged and kicked 
the adventurers out, one by one.

17:51.990 --> 17:54.420
And if only that had been the end of it...

17:55.630 --> 17:59.170
What?! The guards arrested him?!

17:59.840 --> 18:04.060
Yes, that's just how bad Dorinthol is.

18:04.310 --> 18:07.960
When I was taken there the first 
time, I couldn't believe it.

18:09.270 --> 18:12.300
Master Cain! Please help me!

18:12.300 --> 18:13.990
What happened, Seth?

18:13.990 --> 18:16.430
He has horns... That must mean...

18:16.430 --> 18:18.670
This is the Prince of Darkness?

18:19.280 --> 18:22.120
He looks quite battered 
for a Prince of Darkness.

18:22.120 --> 18:23.760
Master Cain!

18:24.080 --> 18:28.710
My wife learned of my infidelity 
and kicked me out of the castle!

18:28.710 --> 18:31.140
And you came to me?

18:31.140 --> 18:35.000
So this is where you went.

18:35.290 --> 18:36.970
Lefahne!

18:36.970 --> 18:41.250
Are you not aware of the trouble 
you're causing by doing this?

18:41.670 --> 18:45.560
A pleasure to meet you. 
I am Lefahne von Dalstein.

18:45.560 --> 18:48.330
I apologize for what my husband has done.

18:48.980 --> 18:49.840
How beautiful!

18:49.840 --> 18:51.020
How dashing!

18:51.250 --> 18:55.480
Nice to meet you. I am 
Cain von Silford Dorinthol.

18:55.720 --> 19:00.150
Master Cain, I will get an 
explanation from my husband later.

19:00.570 --> 19:02.950
For now, allow me to get right to the point.

19:03.210 --> 19:05.910
What do you think of him as a man?

19:05.910 --> 19:07.900
It's inexcusable.

19:07.900 --> 19:08.800
What?!

19:08.800 --> 19:10.410
Well, of course it is!

19:10.410 --> 19:12.740
How could you even think 
about any other woman

19:12.740 --> 19:15.830
when you have an 
unparalleled beauty like this?!

19:15.830 --> 19:19.210
Oh, my! Unparalleled beauty, you say?

19:19.210 --> 19:22.400
She was such a sweet girl 
before I married her...

19:22.740 --> 19:25.320
You'd best be careful, as well, Master Cain.

19:25.320 --> 19:27.890
Women change after marriage.

19:28.640 --> 19:33.440
Lord Seth, I don't think you should 
talk like that after cheating on her.

19:33.440 --> 19:39.660
I bet you said all kinds of sweet things 
to her before marrying her, didn't you?

19:39.660 --> 19:43.120
Exactly! Like, "You're the only one I see"...

19:43.120 --> 19:45.500
And, "I'll treasure you forever!"

19:45.500 --> 19:47.940
Once you've exchanged your wedding vows...

19:47.940 --> 19:50.480
...betrayal is unforgivable!

19:50.830 --> 19:53.070
<i>Why do I feel this way?</i>

19:53.070 --> 19:55.850
<i>It's not like I'm the one 
who did wrong here...</i>

19:56.790 --> 19:58.780
What a relief!

19:58.780 --> 20:02.450
You said everything that I wanted to say!

20:02.450 --> 20:06.760
And, Master Cain, if you ever do 
anything to make these girls cry...

20:07.310 --> 20:09.390
You know what will happen, don't you?

20:09.850 --> 20:11.180
Yes, ma'am!

20:11.410 --> 20:14.430
Now, dear, you're coming home with me.

20:14.430 --> 20:16.020
What? I can?

20:16.020 --> 20:19.790
Just this once! And only 
because everyone is watching!

20:20.170 --> 20:22.270
Well, then, farewell.

20:22.940 --> 20:25.130
Come visit us again!

20:25.130 --> 20:28.160
We'll send you a proper 
invitation to tea next time!

20:28.370 --> 20:32.070
Master Cain! Try not to take 
things too far yourself!

20:32.790 --> 20:34.540
But then Master Cain...

20:34.810 --> 20:35.890
Yes?!

20:35.890 --> 20:38.750
He stormed into the church, complaining 
that they demanded too much in tithes.

20:38.750 --> 20:40.960
The church?!

20:41.440 --> 20:44.530
When the guild and the underground guild
 came to attack the priest

20:44.530 --> 20:46.400
under the cover of darkness,

20:46.400 --> 20:48.430
he was already there...

20:48.430 --> 20:49.850
and turned them away with utmost ease!

20:49.850 --> 20:51.600
Things went that far?!

20:51.960 --> 20:56.430
Oh, no! Master Cain took things 
even further than that!

20:56.750 --> 20:57.890
He built a wall!

20:57.890 --> 20:58.940
A wall?

21:03.490 --> 21:05.050
You're all right with this?

21:05.050 --> 21:06.560
Of course.

21:06.970 --> 21:12.730
There are still many things 
we need him to do.

21:13.100 --> 21:15.160
But, dear husband...

21:15.160 --> 21:16.750
Cain...

21:16.750 --> 21:19.850
Building a castle even more 
impressive than Father's?

21:20.210 --> 21:21.800
Isn't this...

21:22.030 --> 21:24.040
...taking things a bit too far?!

21:24.040 --> 21:25.380
Cain!

21:25.660 --> 21:27.090
Cain!

21:25.680 --> 21:27.090
Master Cain!

21:28.940 --> 21:30.560
Too far?

21:30.560 --> 21:34.810
Yes! Why was this necessary?!

21:35.590 --> 21:39.110
<i>Because I reincarnated into this 
world with all my past memories</i>

21:39.110 --> 21:42.510
<i>and became an off-the-charts noble</i>

21:42.510 --> 21:45.120
<i>with level-10 protections from all the gods.</i>

21:45.610 --> 21:50.030
<i>But that's a story for next time.</i>

23:20.710 --> 23:22.670
Cain!

23:20.710 --> 23:22.670
Master Cain!

23:23.620 --> 23:25.500
Sorry!

23:26.330 --> 23:32.390
I'm seriously... so sorry!

23:35.010 --> 23:40.250
<b>Thank You For Watching</b>
